
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_ALLIANCE_WITH_THE_BUFFALO]
Alliance with the Buffalo

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_ALLIANCE_WITH_THE_BUFFALO_desc]
The Buffalo Tribe had always claimed that the Apple Family stole their food and land, while the Apple Family regarded the buffaloes as nothing but troublemakers. Yet, before the War, the two sides still treated each other with mutual respect under the influence of Harmony.\nIf they could coexist back then, why can’t they now?\nWith that question in mind, perhaps a personal visit to the Buffalo Tribe would be the best choice.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_ALLIANCE_WITH_THE_BUFFALO]
与野牛交好

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_ALLIANCE_WITH_THE_BUFFALO_desc]
野牛家族一直声称苹果家族抢走了他们的食物和土地，而苹果家族将野牛家族视为麻烦精，然而，在终末之战开始前，俩家还在谐律的感染下相敬如宾，如果之前可以，那么现在又为什么不行了呢，带着这个问题，也许同样亲自去野牛部落走访一下最合适
